celmedicalimaging.com/contactus/\",\"area\":\"New Port Richey\",\"category\":\"Published fixed\",\"checked\":\"2026-10-24 00:00:00\",\"coverage\":\"5626 Gulf Drive, New Port Richey, FL 34652; 727-841-8212.\",\"ct\":\"General noncontrast $239; contrast-only $279; without/with $299. Combined abdomen/pelvis $329/$349/$395 respectively.\",\"entity\":\"Independent outpatient imaging center\",\"location_type\":\"unresolved\",\"locations\":[],\"mri\":\"General noncontrast $299 promotional ($349 normal); contrast-only $379; without/with $399. Open MRI without/with $429; specialty exams separate.\",\"name\":\"Excel Medical Imaging \\u2014 New Port Richey\",\"notes\":\"Pay at service. January 6, 2026 schedule; promotion expiry unspecified. Reading/facility fees are not separately itemized; confirm all-in protocol total, contrast/lab charges and availability. Self-referral is offered with limitations, radiologist review, possible independent labs and required waivers; not a recommendation to self-order. Whole-body screening and St. Petersburg macrocenter are separate. Checked 2026-10-24.\",\"other\":\"General ultrasound $129; chest/KUB two-view X-ray $39; other general X-rays $49; DEXA $69.\",\"row\":\"178\",\"source\":\"https://www.excelmedicalimaging.com/self-pay-prices/\",\"states\":\"FL\"}"},{"content_hash":"e9aee6aeb8fa0b7484dae756e9b7f38d405c4bce8215fd94f74eae5fdb70041e","entry_key":"9d0c3976123a2d63aa8efc1c9f9e1d2b3da29b1a05e721fd369eb7613fe0a28e","payload":"{\"additional\":\"https://www.gatewaydiagnostic.com/patients/patient-billing/\",\"area\":\"Abilene\",\"category\":\"Quote required\",\"checked\":\"2026-10-24 00:00:00\",\"coverage\":\"4349 S. Treadaway Blvd., Abilene, TX 79602; 325-695-4624.\",\"ct\":\"Quote required\",\"entity\":\"Independent outpatient imaging center\",\"location_type\":\"unresolved\",\"locations\":[],\"mri\":\"Quote required; 3T MRI and open MRI\",\"name\":\"Gateway Diagnostic Imaging \\u2014 Abilene\",\"notes\":\"Branch explicitly offers uninsur