part/protocol and whether with-and-without exam qualifies before purchase. With-contrast price published, no separate contrast fee stated. No claim of hospital savings. Page undated; checked 2026-10-26. Existing city, new facility.\",\"other\":\"Cardiac calcium scoring CT $75 (screening); X-ray from $65; ultrasound/mammography quote required\",\"row\":\"183\",\"source\":\"https://mountainwestmc.com/simple-price/\",\"states\":\"UT\"}"},{"content_hash":"dafccff0fc047877ec017fec0578df648bf717f50e0e041ead2f202f026c7764","entry_key":"1ab9f07e51d003388207acdbb1fe3702d444b6140822d8b05a6e2b17d8fb05a5","payload":"{\"additional\":\"https://taylormedmri.com/locations/\\nhttps://taylormedmri.com/about/\\nhttps://taylormedmri.com/what-to-expect/\\nhttps://taylormedmri.com/\",\"area\":\"Lindon\",\"category\":\"Published fixed\",\"checked\":\"2026-10-26 00:00:00\",\"coverage\":\"1780 W 700 N, Suite 30, Lindon, UT 84042; 385-831-7674 (central).\",\"ct\":\"Not offered in verified sources\",\"entity\":\"Independent outpatient MRI center\",\"location_type\":\"unresolved\",\"locations\":[],\"mri\":\"$399 per listed spine/joint/pelvis region; brain $499 or $399 with doctor order; abdomen $499; no contrast studies\",\"name\":\"TaylorMED MRI \\u2014 Lindon\",\"notes\":\"Operator-published service schedule, not another branch price. Location explicitly confirmed on operator site; confirm exact exam at this location. Each body region billed separately. Scan/report/images included; optional radiologist phone discussion $150 extra. Payment due at service; no insurance billing; HSA/FSA accepted. No physician order generally required, but brain price differs with order. PIP/lien exams excluded from cash rates. FAQ says contrast studies, arthrograms and sedation unavailable. No hospital-savings claim adopted. Pages undated; checked 2026-10-26.\",\"other\":\"No CT/ultrasound/X-ray offer verified. Breast implant exam not offered at Lindon (Salt Lake City only).\",\"row\":\"184\",\"source\":\"https://taylormedmri.com/services/\",\"states\":\"UT\"}"},{"content_hash":"0987ca040ceaded88006c938bfe8aa34e5d1e485c1779d67f2c28f57400981c4","entry_key":"7c338785d8ef7c370b3e5f4707cd3798f6b5b8edc597c3762ccc3edb88cbe344","payload":"{\"additional\":\"https://www.qhmri.com/en/faq.html\\nhttps://www.qhmri.com/en/index.html\",\"area\":\"Sunnyvale\",\"category\":\"Published fixed\",\"checked\":\"2026-10-27 00:00:00\",\"coverage\":\"1307 S Mary Ave, Suite 101, Sunnyvale, CA 94087; 650-445-9087 (center phone/text).\",\"ct\":\"Not offered in verified sources\",\"entity\":\"Independent outpatient MRI center\",\"location_type\":\"unresolved\",\"locations\":[],\"mri\":\"$450 scan-only facility fee per anatomical region; optional written radiologist report $65; scan + report $515\",\"name\":\"QHMRI Center \\u2014 Sunnyvale\",\"notes\":\"Effective August 1, 2026. $450 includes scheduled-region MRI protocol, digital images, safety screening and technologist support; NOT radiologist interpretation. Optional formal written report adds $65 (FAQ describes NDI professional fee separately). Referral/order/written recommendation required from authorized provider. Payment due at service; self-pay, not an insurance quote. Routine spine/joint exams generally without contrast; contrast/arthrogram availability and price not confirmed. Upright/supine positioning depends on clinical suitability, not automatically both. Medicare/Medicare Advantage patients must confirm billing/enrollment; no reimbursement assurance. Checked 2026-10-27.\",\"other\":\"Routine spine/joint MRI; additional regions, bilateral exams or separate services may cost more.\",\"row\":\"185\",\"source\":\"https://www.qhmri.com/en/self-pay.html\",\"states\":\"CA\"}"},{"content_hash":"28c1aec896066424220182ccdd3952bcde47b8493ae449d591e0c3ff58db4302","entry_key":"39ec5d4147155a481b894931ce24c4757322cae09d874fe5431e8670fcd3ed6b","payload":"{\"additional\":\"https://www.floridaortho.com/locations/brandon/\\nhttps://www.floridaortho.com